      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A single case of back pain due to Blastomyces dermatitidis infection limited solely to the skeleton is reported with a discussion of the differential diagnosis. This rare disease must be differentiated from other destructive bone lesions such as tuberculosis or tumors because of the availability of effective treatment."},
